data: {"id": "34b8ed2403cd48f3-thinking-layer-342", "run_id": "34b8ed2403cd48f3", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我注意到 Pod 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。根据 `pod-crashloop-runtime.md` 手册，我需要检查是否存在 `OOMKilled` 的迹象。因为 OOMKilled 也是 CrashLoopBackOff 的一种常见原因，且手册中明确指出：如果 `Last State Reason=OOMKilled`，应切换到 `pod-oomkilled` runbook。\n\n为了确保覆盖所有可能性，我也获取 `pod-oomkilled.md` 手册，以便在后续检查 Pod 详情时判断是否需要切换诊断路径。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789136072041}

